{
  "name": "documents",
  "title": "Document Management",
  "description": "S3-basierte Dokumentenverwaltung mit Presigned Uploads, rollenbasiertem Zugriff und Soft-Delete.",
  "version": "1.0.0",

  "dependencies": {
    "@aws-sdk/client-s3": "^3.800.0",
    "@aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner": "^3.800.0"
  },

  "uiRegistryDependencies": [
    "pagination",
    "page-header",
    "sheet-form",
    "search-filter"
  ],

  "featureRegistryDependencies": [],

  "requiredEnv": [
    "S3_ENDPOINT",
    "S3_REGION",
    "S3_BUCKET",
    "S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID",
    "S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY"
  ],

  "files": [
    {
      "source": "prisma/document.prisma",
      "target": "prisma/fragments/document.prisma",
      "type": "prisma-fragment",
      "hint": "Fuege diese Models und Enums in dein schema.prisma ein. Passe DocumentType an deine Beduerfnisse an und ergaenze Relationen zu deinen Entities."
    },
    {
      "source": "utils/s3.ts",
      "target": "src/lib/utils/s3.ts",
      "type": "util",
      "hint": "S3-Client und Hilfsfunktionen. Falls du bereits eine s3.ts hast, merge die fehlenden Funktionen."
    },
    {
      "source": "types/document.ts",
      "target": "src/lib/types/document.ts",
      "type": "types"
    },
    {
      "source": "api/+server.ts",
      "target": "src/routes/api/documents/+server.ts",
      "type": "api-route"
    },
    {
      "source": "api/create-presigned-url/+server.ts",
      "target": "src/routes/api/documents/create-presigned-url/+server.ts",
      "type": "api-route"
    },
    {
      "source": "api/confirm-presigned-upload/+server.ts",
      "target": "src/routes/api/documents/confirm-presigned-upload/+server.ts",
      "type": "api-route"
    },
    {
      "source": "api/[id]/+server.ts",
      "target": "src/routes/api/documents/[id]/+server.ts",
      "type": "api-route"
    },
    {
      "source": "api/[id]/file/+server.ts",
      "target": "src/routes/api/documents/[id]/file/+server.ts",
      "type": "api-route"
    },
    {
      "source": "components/form/form.svelte",
      "target": "src/lib/components/documents/form/form.svelte",
      "type": "component"
    },
    {
      "source": "components/data-table/columns.ts",
      "target": "src/lib/components/documents/data-table/columns.ts",
      "type": "component"
    },
    {
      "source": "components/data-table/data-table.svelte",
      "target": "src/lib/components/documents/data-table/data-table.svelte",
      "type": "component"
    },
    {
      "source": "components/data-table/data-table-actions.svelte",
      "target": "src/lib/components/documents/data-table/data-table-actions.svelte",
      "type": "component"
    },
    {
      "source": "components/data-table/type-badge.svelte",
      "target": "src/lib/components/documents/data-table/type-badge.svelte",
      "type": "component"
    }
  ],

  "i18n": {
    "merge": true,
    "sources": {
      "de": "i18n/de.json",
      "en": "i18n/en.json"
    },
    "targetKey": "documents"
  },

  "postInstall": [
    "Prisma-Fragment aus prisma/fragments/document.prisma in dein schema.prisma einfuegen",
    "DocumentType-Enum an deine Beduerfnisse anpassen (eigene Typen hinzufuegen/entfernen)",
    "Relationen zu deinen Entities ergaenzen (z.B. projectId, employeeId)",
    "npx prisma migrate dev --name add_documents",
    "npx prisma generate",
    ".env um S3-Variablen ergaenzen (siehe requiredEnv)",
    "S3-Bucket erstellen und CORS konfigurieren fuer Presigned Uploads"
  ]
}
